<task id="admin-task-install-fedora-44-source" xml:lang="zh-CN" audience="administrator devops" product="bpm-0-9-1" platform="linux"><title>在 Fedora Linux 44 上从源代码安装 BPM</title><shortdesc>使用 Fedora Python 3.14 完整安装 BPM。</shortdesc><taskbody><prereq><p>需要 Fedora 44、sudo、HTTPS 和已批准的引用。</p></prereq><context><p>这是单节点源代码运行，不是 systemd 或生产方案。</p></context><steps>
<step><cmd>安装必备软件。</cmd><info><codeblock conref="../../en/admin/admin-task-install-fedora-44-source.dita#admin-task-install-fedora-44-source/distro-prep"/></info></step><step><cmd>检出 BPM。</cmd><info><codeblock conref="../../en/admin/admin-task-install-fedora-44-source.dita#admin-task-install-fedora-44-source/checkout"/></info></step><step><cmd>安装并迁移 BPM。</cmd><info><codeblock conref="../../en/admin/admin-task-install-fedora-44-source.dita#admin-task-install-fedora-44-source/install"/></info></step><step><cmd>构建文档。</cmd><info><codeblock conref="../../en/admin/admin-task-install-fedora-44-source.dita#admin-task-install-fedora-44-source/docs"/></info></step><step><cmd>启动 BPM。</cmd><info><codeblock conref="../../en/admin/admin-task-install-fedora-44-source.dita#admin-task-install-fedora-44-source/start"/></info></step><step><cmd>检查结果。</cmd><info><codeblock conref="../../en/admin/admin-task-install-fedora-44-source.dita#admin-task-install-fedora-44-source/verify"/></info></step><step><cmd>安全停止。</cmd><info><p>保留 DNF、pip、迁移、构建和日志输出；不要降级数据库。</p></info></step>
</steps><result><p>BPM 已迁移，文档已构建，探针正常响应。</p></result><postreq><p>在 Fedora 44 上验证。</p></postreq></taskbody><related-links><link keyref="topic.admin-task-prepare-linux-source-deployment"/><link keyref="topic.admin-task-verify-linux-source-deployment"/></related-links></task>
